sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as NoteCard / asset client
    participant IDB as Browser IndexedDB
    participant Notes as Vuex / localStorage
    participant API as Hono API (session cookie)
    participant Disk as Note storage

    User->>UI: Attach one or more files
    UI->>UI: Check 50 MiB limit and generate UUID filename
    UI->>IDB: Store original Blob under owner/year/month/assets/name
    IDB-->>UI: Transaction committed
    alt Authenticated
        UI->>API: PUT /notes/{encodedNoteId}/assets/{filename} (raw bytes)
        API->>API: Authenticate and validate paths, limit, and source note
        API->>Disk: Atomically publish year/month.d/assets/filename
        Disk-->>API: Saved (or identical retry)
        API-->>UI: 201 {filename, path, size}
        UI->>IDB: Mark account copy synced
    else Anonymous
        Note over UI,IDB: No asset HTTP request, bytes remain browser-local
    end
    UI->>Notes: Insert [name](../assets/filename) at cursor / append in Preview
    Notes->>Notes: Existing debounced note save to localStorage
    opt Authenticated note save
        Notes->>API: POST /notes/{encodedNoteId} {content, revision}
        API->>Disk: Conflict-checked Markdown save
        API-->>Notes: New revision
    end

    opt Later anonymous login
        Notes->>API: POST /notes/import {id, content}
        API->>Disk: Create collision-free note in original date directory
        API-->>Notes: New note ID (same month)
        Notes->>IDB: Find referenced anonymous Blobs
        Notes->>API: PUT assets using imported note ID
        API->>Disk: Save in original month/assets
        Note over Notes,Disk: Relative Markdown links stay unchanged
    end

    User->>UI: Click an asset link in Preview
    UI->>IDB: Look up owner/month/filename
    alt Blob already cached
        IDB-->>UI: Original Blob (works offline)
    else Uncached authenticated asset
        UI->>API: GET /notes/{encodedNoteId}/assets/{filename}
        API->>Disk: Read authenticated user's month asset
        Disk-->>API: Binary bytes
        API-->>UI: 200 attachment, octet-stream, nosniff, sandbox
        UI->>IDB: Cache downloaded Blob
    end
    UI-->>User: Download via short-lived Blob URL
